function categoryTabs(){if(tab==='notes')return [['all','All notes'],['pinned','Pinned'],...noteCategories().map(category=>[categoryFilter('note',category),category])];if(tab==='recipes'&&foodView==='recipes')return [['all','All'],...RECIPE_CATEGORIES.map(category=>[categoryFilter('recipe',category),category])];return []}
